WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.543
Lab 2 uses a Microsoft 365 test
tenant in the worldwide or GCC cloud,

2
00:00:05.543 --> 00:00:09.837
never production, signed in
as a test administrator.

3
00:00:09.837 --> 00:00:12.986
Sign in delegated, in
the Global environment,

4
00:00:12.986 --> 00:00:17.325
with only the two read scopes;
an administrator consents once.

5
00:00:17.325 --> 00:00:21.812
Cross-check with Learn's own cmdlet: its
count of posts and the kit's should agree.

6
00:00:21.812 --> 00:00:24.203
Then look at the posts that need action,

7
00:00:24.203 --> 00:00:27.342
confirm each has Microsoft's
basis or the kit's rule,

8
00:00:27.342 --> 00:00:32.199
and record the tags you see on retirement
posts, because Learn doesn't list them.

9
00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:38.300
Finally, sign out, delete the run, and remove
any consent granted only for this lab.
